      "title": "Isotopic Variations in Meteoric Waters",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>The relationship between deuterium and oxygen-18 concentrations in natural meteoric waters from many parts of the world has been determined with a mass spectrometer. The isotopic enrichments, relative to ocean water, display a linear correlation over the entire range for waters which have not undergone excessive evaporation.</jats:p>",
